  {
    "RowOffset": 1041110,
    "RowId": 18295,
    "Description": "Deals wind damage to all enemies in a straight line before you with a potency of 220 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1041266,
    "RowId": 18296,
    "Description": "Deals water damage to all enemies in a cone before you with a potency of 220 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>15-yalm knockback"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1041478,
    "RowId": 18297,
    "Description": "Deals ice damage to all enemies in a cone before you with a potency of 220 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Enemies affected by <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Dropsy</span> are frozen. The <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Dropsy</span> effect is also removed.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>20s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1041834,
    "RowId": 18298,
    "Description": "Deals lightning damage to target and all enemies nearby it with a potency of 220 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1041986,
    "RowId": 18299,
    "Description": "Deals physical damage to all enemies in a cone before you with a potency of 220 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1042138,
    "RowId": 18300,
    "Description": "Deals physical damage with a potency of 220.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span><span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Paralysis</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1042314,
    "RowId": 18301,
    "Description": "Puts all nearby enemies to sleep.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>40s\nCancels auto-attack upon execution."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1042438,
    "RowId": 18302,
    "Description": "Removes one beneficial effect from all nearby enemies."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1042506,
    "RowId": 18303,
    "Description": "Restores target's HP.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Cure Potency: </span>100\nCure potency is increased to 500 when you are under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: Healer</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1042702,
    "RowId": 18304,
    "Description": "Creates a barrier around self and all nearby party members that absorbs damage equivalent to a heal of 100 potency.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30s\nBarrier strength is increased to absorb damage equivalent to a heal of 250 potency when you are under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: Healer</span>.\nEffect cannot be stacked with those of scholar's <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Galvanize</span> or sage's <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Eukrasian Diagnosis</span> and <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Eukrasian Prognosis</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1043230,
    "RowId": 18305,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage to target and all enemies nearby it with a potency of 250 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Lowers intelligence and mind attributes by 10%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>10s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Restores 10% of maximum MP\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Candy Cane</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1043658,
    "RowId": 18306,
    "Description": "Direct damage intended for you to another party member.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>12s\nCan only be executed when member is within 10 yalms. Does not activate with certain attacks.\nThis action does not share a recast timer with any other actions."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1043930,
    "RowId": 18307,
    "Description": "Provoke nearby enemies, placing yourself at the top of their enmity list."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1044014,
    "RowId": 18308,
    "Description": "Deals wind damage with a potency of 210."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1044066,
    "RowId": 18309,
    "Description": "Increases the potency of the next physical damage spell cast by 80%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30s\nEffect cannot be stacked with <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Boost</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1044250,
    "RowId": 18310,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage to all enemies in a straight line before you with a potency of 200 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Potency is increased to 400 when enemies are bound. The <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Bind</span> effect is also removed.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span><span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Slow</span> +20%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 20s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1044690,
    "RowId": 18311,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage to all enemies in a straight line before you with a potency of 200 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Potency is increased to 400 when enemies are under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Slow</span>. The <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Slow</span> effect is also removed.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span><span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Bind</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 20s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1045166,
    "RowId": 18312,
    "Description": "KOs all nearby enemies.\nChance of successful attack is low.\nEnemy level must be a multiple of 5. Has no effect on enemies whose level is higher than your own.\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Ultravibration</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1045414,
    "RowId": 18313,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack to all nearby enemies randomly dealing 50%, 30%, 20%, or 10% of their HP.\nHas no effect on enemies whose level is higher than your own."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1045582,
    "RowId": 18314,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 220.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span><span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Stun</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>1s\nIgnores target's <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Stun</span> resistance."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1045818,
    "RowId": 18315,
    "Description": "Reduces target party member's damage taken by 5%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>6s\nIncreases damage reduction to 15% when you are under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: Tank</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1046038,
    "RowId": 18316,
    "Description": "Deals physical damage with a potency of 50.\nPotency is increased to 500 when your HP is below 20%."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1046150,
    "RowId": 18317,
    "Description": "Resurrects target to a weakened state.\nThis action does not share a recast timer with any other actions."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1046270,
    "RowId": 18318,
    "Description": "Restores own HP and the HP of all nearby party members.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Cure Potency: </span>50\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Removes one detrimental effect from all nearby party members\nCure potency is increased to 300 when you are under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: Healer</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1046606,
    "RowId": 18319,
    "Description": "Deals lightning damage with a potency of 220.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span><span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Heavy</span> +40%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>10s\nIgnores target's <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Heavy</span> resistance."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1046846,
    "RowId": 18320,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 250.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Increases maximum HP by 20%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>15s\nIncreases duration to 70s when you are under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: Tank</span>.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Restores an amount of own HP equal to damage dealt\nThis action does not share a recast timer with any other actions."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1047294,
    "RowId": 18321,
    "Description": "Afflicts target with <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Physical Attenuation</span>, <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Astral Attenuation</span>, or <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Umbral Attenuation</span>.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>30s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Physical Attenuation Effect: </span>Increases damage taken from physical attacks by 5%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Astral Attenuation Effect: </span>Increases damage taken from fire-, wind-, and lightning-aspected attacks by 5%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Umbral Attenuation Effect: </span>Increases damage taken from water-, earth-, and ice-aspected attacks by 5%\nOnly one of these statuses can be applied to a target at a time."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1047942,
    "RowId": 18322,
    "Description": "Mirror the aetheric properties of your target, granting yourself a beneficial effect corresponding with the target's role.\nIf target is a tank, grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: Tank</span>, increasing your defense and augmenting certain blue magic spells.\nIf target is a DPS, grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: DPS</span>, increasing critical hit rate and direct hit rate by 20%, as well as augmenting certain blue magic spells.\nIf target is a healer, grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aetheric Mimicry: Healer</span>, increasing healing potency by 20% and augmenting certain blue magic spells.\nCannot be cast on self. Effect ends upon reuse."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1048614,
    "RowId": 18323,
    "Description": "Deals earth damage to all enemies in a cone before you with a potency of 200 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Grants <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Surpanakha's Fury</span>, increasing potency of <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Surpanakha</span> by 50%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>3s\nCan be stacked up to 3 times.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Maximum Charges: </span>4\nEffect is canceled upon execution of any action other than <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Surpanakha</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1049142,
    "RowId": 18324,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage to all nearby enemies with a potency of 300 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">J Kick</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1049346,
    "RowId": 18325,
    "Description": "Delivers a jumping physical attack to target and all enemies nearby it with a potency of 300 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.\nCannot be executed while bound.\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Quasar</span>."
  },
